# .dockerignore - what the GLOW image build leaves out of the GLOWanalyses tree it copies.
# The official build context is the released tree (what the ZWuLab/GLOWanalyses tag holds), which
# carries no study configuration; a build from a development checkout leaves these out as well.
# File Log: 2026-10-22 (later) the development-only run folders added after the review round;
#           2026-10-22 created by Claude Code (Fable 5.1), prompted by ZWu (plan 12).
.git
**/outputs
**/outputs/**
**/*.sif
runs/example-als
runs/example-wdl
